2026-10-09T17:22:57.0453383Z   ok   a copy in ANOTHER module is one copy, whatever its locals are called (#1738 a)
2026-10-09T17:22:57.0453582Z   ok   a third copy costs one more, not two more: copies, not pairs
2026-10-09T17:22:57.0453800Z   ok   a re-wrap or a comment moves nothing: the window is the AST, not the lines
2026-10-09T17:22:57.0454016Z   ok   the node floor holds: two short shared statements are not a copy
